-- Super-tap interrupts. GENERATED by gen-super-interrupts.sh — do not edit.
--
-- The launcher opens on RELEASE of a bare Super tap. While Super is held,
-- pressing anything else has to cancel that pending open, or Super+Shift+S
-- takes a screenshot AND opens the launcher when Super comes up.
--
-- Up to Hyprland 0.55 a single `binditn = SUPER, catchall` did this for every
-- key at once. On 0.56 catchall is submap-only, so every SUPER combination
-- instead gets a second, `transparent` bind firing the interrupt. Transparent
-- means Hyprland keeps scanning after it, so the real bind on the same keys
-- still runs.
hl.bind("CTRL + SUPER + ALT + T", hl.dsp.global("quickshell:superComboInterrupt"), { transparent = true })
